# Optional explicit primary/replica routing:
# DATABASE_URL_PRIMARY is the write/master database.
# DATABASE_URL_REPLICA is the read-only replica used for GET/HEAD requests.
# If DATABASE_URL_PRIMARY is set and DATABASE_URL is not, DATABASE_URL becomes an alias for PRIMARY.
# If only DATABASE_URL is set, it is used for both primary and replica.
